      "title": "Uncontrolled Resource Consumption in org.eclipse.jetty.http2:http2-common",
      "description": "Affected versions of org.eclipse.jetty.http3:jetty-http3-common, org.eclipse.jetty.http2:jetty-http2-common, org.eclipse.jetty.http3:http3-common, and org.eclipse.jetty.http2:http2-common are vulnerable to Uncontrolled Resource Consumption. The vulnerability stems from a flaw in managing HTTP/2 and HTTP/3 connections where TCP congestion leads to idle timeouts, potentially resulting in the connection staying open despite being marked as closed",
